<h2>The case in one view</h2>
<table class="law">
  <tr><th>Case</th><td>Dr. Amrit Kejriwal v. Dr. Jaya Kejriwal, First Appeal No. 206 of 2018</td></tr>
  <tr><th>Court</th><td>High Court of Jharkhand at Ranchi, Division Bench (M.S. Sonak, C.J. and Manoj Prasad, J.)</td></tr>
